The '''Tetuán-Zofío''' ({{IPA-bl|teˈtwan soˈfi.o}}) is one of the three [[Commune district|legislative districts]] in the city of [[Calatayud]], within the [[Llaragón]] (9) region. Like the other 735 Baliscan commune districts, it elects one [[Confederal Congress|delegate]] using the {{W|instant-runoff voting}} system.

